## The Process to File a CA Lemon Law Claim

- Contact the manufacturer immediately after you notice a defect. You will be directed to a nearby certified facility to begin the repair process.

- Organize all documentation for the repairs:

- Problem(s) with the vehicle

- Date of repairs

- Time spent in the repair facility

- Invoices

- Receipts

- If the facility is not successful in repairing your defect after multiple attempts, contact a Santa Monica lemon law attorney to file a claim.

